      "statement": "The 2009-04 endorsement covers direct physical loss to covered property caused by earthquake, including defined shaking, tremors, land shock waves, related earth shocks, buildings, structures, personal property, fixtures, foundations, falling, collapse, debris removal, and reasonable emergency measures.",
